  "description": "Local licence plate recognition from a camera snapshot, in process, on CPU: a YOLOv9 plate detector and a CCT OCR model (fast-alpr / fast-plate-ocr ONNX models) run with ONNX Runtime on x64 and arm64 (Linux, Windows). Overlapping tiles find small and far plates, Polish plate rules drop non-plate text and fix I/1 slips. Models are downloaded once (SHA-256 checked) or loaded from a folder - no Python, no service, works offline.",
